          }
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "added",
            "A project states the pub it needs in pub-version.txt or as pub= in .publet/config; pub finds it in the current directory or a parent and, before running any command, stops with exit 2 naming the release to install when it is not met (PUB_IGNORE_VERSION=1 skips this). pub require [REQUIREMENT] checks one for scripts. An unknown command now says which release this is and how to install another."
          ],
          [
            "fixed",
            "pub reads a version requirement only from a regular file, at most 4 KiB of it, skips a byte-order mark and comments after the requirement, and refuses something that is not a requirement by name, quoted, instead of reporting it as unmet; the README documents exit status 2 and the files and variable involved"
          ]
        ]
      },
